<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Anheuser-Busch said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Anheuser-Busch said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer &amp; Co lowered its recommendation on Anheuser-Busch Cos Inc to market perform from buy, according to market sources.</p>
<p>-- In early New York Stock Exchange trade, shares fell 3/8 to 39-1/8.  </p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available to comment.</p>
</text>
